rnace.)>>endobj4337 0 obj<</D(G1540509)/S/GoTo>>endobj4338 0 obj<</A 4339 0 R/Next 4336 0 R/Parent 2747 0 R/Prev 4340 0 R/Title(12. Replace main door.)>>endobj4339 0 obj<</D(G1540508)/S/GoTo>>endobj4340 0 obj<</A 4341 0 R/Next 4338 0 R/Parent 2747 0 R/Prev 4342 0 R/Title(11. If a condensate pump is used, check with pump manufacturer to verify pump is safe for use with antifreeze used. Allow pump to start and pump anti-freeze to open drain.)>>endobj4341 0 obj<</D(G1540507)/S/GoTo>>endobj4342 0 obj<</A 4343 0 R/Next 4340 0 R/Parent 2747 0 R/Prev 4344 0 R/Title(10. Repeat Steps 5 through 8.)>>endobj4343 0 obj<</D(G1540506)/S/GoTo>>endobj4344 0 obj<</A 4345 0 R/Next 4342 0 R/Parent 2747 0 R/Prev 4346 0 R/Title(9. Remove the middle unused rubber plug from the port on the collector box opposite the condensate trap. See Fig. 62.)>>endobj4345 0 obj<</D(G1540505)/S/GoTo>>endobj4346 0 obj<</A 4347 0 R/Next 4344 0 R/Parent 2747 0 R/Prev 4348 0 R/Title(8. Replace the rubber plug in the port on the collector box.)>>endobj4347 0 obj<</D(G1540504)/S/GoTo>>endobj4348 0 obj<</A 4349 0 R/Next 4346 0 R/Parent 2747 0 R/Prev 4350 0 R/Title(7. Pour one quart \(liter\) of anti-freeze solution into the funnel/tube. Antifreeze should run through the inducer housing, overfill condensate trap and flow to an open drain.)>>endobj4349 0 obj<</D(G1540490)/S/GoTo>>endobj4350 0 obj<</A 4351 0 R/Next 4348 0 R/Parent 2747 0 R/Prev 4352 0 R/Title(6. Insert a field supplied funnel into the tube.)>>endobj4351 0 obj<</D(G1540489)/S/GoTo>>endobj4352 0 obj<</A 4353 0 R/Next 4350 0 R/Parent 2747 0 R/Prev 4354 0 R/Title(5. Connect a field supplied 3/8-in. \(9.5-mm\) ID tube to the open port on the collector box.)>>endobj4353 0 obj<</D(G1540488)/S/GoTo>>endobj4354 0 obj<</A 4355 0 R/Next 4352 0 R/Parent 2747 0 R/Prev 4356 0 R/Title(4. Remove the top unused rubber plug from the port on the collector box opposite the condensate trap. See Fig. 62.)>>endobj4