e blo...)>>endobj4370 0 obj<</D(G1540520)/S/GoTo>>endobj4371 0 obj<</A 4372 0 R/Next 4369 0 R/Parent 2743 0 R/Prev 4373 0 R/Title(d. Flame-Proving- When the burner flame is proved at the flame-proving sensor electrode FSE, the furnace control CPU begins the blower-ON delay period and continues to hold the gas valve GV open. If the burner flame is not proved within two sec, the ...)>>endobj4372 0 obj<</D(G1540519)/S/GoTo>>endobj4373 0 obj<</A 4374 0 R/Next 4371 0 R/Parent 2743 0 R/Prev 4375 0 R/Title(c. Trial-for-Ignition Sequence- When the igniter warm-up period is completed, the main gas valve relay contacts GVR close to energize the gas valve GV, the gas valve opens. The gas valve GV permits gas flow to the burners where it is ignited by the H...)>>endobj4374 0 obj<</D(G1540518)/S/GoTo>>endobj4375 0 obj<</A 4376 0 R/Next 4373 0 R/Parent 2743 0 R/Prev 4377 0 R/Title(b. Igniter Warm-Up- At the end of the prepurge period, the Hot-Surface igniter HSI is energized for a 17-sec igniter warm-up period.)>>endobj4376 0 obj<</D(G1540517)/S/GoTo>>endobj4377 0 obj<</A 4378 0 R/Next 4375 0 R/Parent 2743 0 R/Prev 2745 0 R/Title(a. Inducer Prepurge Period- As the inducer motor IDM comes up to speed, the collector box pressure switch contacts LPS close, 24 VAC power is supplied for a field installed humidifier at the HUM terminal and the control begins a 15-sec prepurge perio...)>>endobj4378 0 obj<</D(G1540516)/S/GoTo>>endobj4379 0 obj<</D(G2244111)/S/GoTo>>endobj4380 0 obj<</D(G1540515)/S/GoTo>>endobj4381 0 obj<</D(G2245220)/S/GoTo>>endobj4382 0 obj<</A 4383 0 R/Count -1/First 4384 0 R/Last 4384 0 R/Next 2742 0 R/Parent 2739 0 R/Prev 4385 0 R/Title(Fig. 72 … Troubleshooting Guide)>>endobj4383 0 obj<</D(G2245214)/S/GoTo>>endobj4384 0 obj<</A 4389 0 R/Parent 4382 0 R/Title(A230014)>>endobj4385 0 obj<</A 4386 0 R/Next 4382 0 R/Parent 2739 0 R/Prev 4387 0 R/Title(A221120)>>endobj4386 0 obj<</D(G2683029)/S/GoTo>>endobj4387 0 obj<<